sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as Gateway/Proxy<br/>(Istio/Envoy/AgentGW)<br/>80,443/TCP
    participant EPP as EPP<br/>(llm-d-inference-scheduler)<br/>9002/TCP gRPC
    participant Prefill as Prefill Model Server<br/>(llm-d-cuda)<br/>8000/TCP
    participant Decode as Decode Model Server<br/>(llm-d-cuda)<br/>8000/TCP
    participant KVCache as llm-d-kv-cache<br/>ZeroMQ
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>8000/TCP

    Note over Client,Decode: Flow 1: Optimized Baseline Inference Request

    Client->>Gateway: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTP/HTTPS (TLS if configured)<br/>Gateway-level auth
    Gateway->>EPP: ext-proc request<br/>gRPC 9002/TCP<br/>No encryption (in-cluster)
    EPP->>Decode: GET /metrics<br/>HTTP 8000/TCP<br/>Collect queue depth, KV utilization
    EPP-->>Gateway: Selected endpoint<br/>gRPC response
    Gateway->>Decode: Forward request<br/>HTTP 8000/TCP<br/>No encryption
    Decode-->>Gateway: Streamed response<br/>HTTP 8000/TCP
    Gateway-->>Client: JSON/SSE Response

    Note over Client,Decode: Flow 2: Prefill/Decode Disaggregation

    Client->>Gateway: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    Gateway->>EPP: ext-proc request<br/>gRPC 9002/TCP
    EPP-->>Gateway: Route to prefill server
    Gateway->>Prefill: Forward request<br/>HTTP 8000/TCP
    Prefill->>Decode: KV-cache transfer via NIXL<br/>RDMA/TCP (InfiniBand/RoCE/EFA)
    Decode-->>Gateway: Streamed decode response<br/>HTTP 8000/TCP
    Gateway-->>Client: JSON/SSE Response

    Note over Client,HF: Flow 3: Model Loading (Startup)

    Decode->>HF: Download model weights<br/>HTTPS 443/TCP, TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (HF_TOKEN)
    HF-->>Decode: Model artifacts

    Note over Prom,Decode: Flow 4: Observability

    Prom->>Decode: GET /metrics<br/>HTTP 8000/TCP
    Decode-->>Prom: Prometheus metrics<br/>(KV cache util, queue depth, latency)
